        "jsCode": "// staging_C: validates the requested Apify input. Hard caps: 60 URLs, 5 events per URL.\nconst b = $json.body || {};\nconst urls = Array.isArray(b.startUrls) ? b.startUrls : [];\nconst clean = [...new Set(urls.map(u => String(u).trim()).filter(u => /^https:\\/\\/(www\\.)?facebook\\.com\\//.test(u)))];\nif (clean.length === 0 || clean.length > 60) throw new Error('startUrls: 1 to 60 facebook.com URLs required');\nconst maxEvents = Math.min(Math.max(parseInt(b.maxEvents || 5, 10) || 5, 1), 5);\nreturn [{ json: { apifyInput: { startUrls: clean.map(url => ({ url })), maxEvents } } }];"
